* @title Gimpel numeric and deterministic random functions
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, Chapters 15.4, 16.1, 16.3, and 16.7; Catspaw SNOBOL4+ program diskette
* @expect >>>
* -4
* -3
* 3
* 4
* 1
* 7
* 2
* CDBA
* BIG
* <<<
-INCLUDE "FLOOR.INC"
-INCLUDE "RANDOM.INC"
-INCLUDE "RPERMUTE.INC"
-INCLUDE "RSELECT.INC"
	OUTPUT = FLOOR(-3.2)
	OUTPUT = CEIL(-3.2)
	OUTPUT = FLOOR(3.8)
	OUTPUT = CEIL(3.8)
	OUTPUT = RANDOM(10)
	OUTPUT = RANDOM(10)
	OUTPUT = RANDOM(10)
	OUTPUT = RPERMUTE('ABCD')
	OUTPUT = RSELECT('|A|#3#BIG|CAT')
END
